{"kind": "mod", "id": 2519, "name": "Armbands For All", "slug": "armbands-for-all", "teaser": "Nothing against people with no arms, but all bots have arms...why not armbands?", "owner_name": "acidphantasm", "downloads": 3247, "favourites": 19, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.acidphantasm.armbandsforall", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Bots", "category_id": 5, "updated_at": "2026-08-09T06:02:27.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-12-29T06:32:50.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-12-29T06:32:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "1.1.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>Mod Features</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Allows all bots to have an armband slot</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This mod does not change the behaviour of the slot, nor any armbands. Nor does it actually ADD any armbands to bots.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>If you actually want bots to have armbands, might I suggest using <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1594/apbs-acids-progressive-bot-system\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">APBS</a>.</p>\n<p>By default, it can put armbands on scavs, rogues, raiders, and boss guards.</p>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download Armbands for All</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded zip file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the BepInEx folders in the zip file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the BepInEx folders from 7-zip into your SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" alt=\"mZ1aLrW.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/Bepinex/plugins/acidphantasm-armbandsforall</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 6419, "downloads": 59, "published_at": "2025-12-29T06:34:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2519/armbands-for-all/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 6448, "downloads": 3114, "published_at": "2025-12-29T07:22:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2519/armbands-for-all/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.1", "content_length": 6540, "downloads": 74, "published_at": "2026-08-09T03:26:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2519/armbands-for-all/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/acidphantasm/armbandsforall/", "label": ""}]}